<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICA'S JSE ELECTS NEW COMMITTEE.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICA'S JSE ELECTS NEW COMMITTEE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange announced on Wednesday that Mike Fergusson, Wayne Lawson-Turnbull, Carmen Maynard and John Turner had been elected as members of its 1997/98 committee.</p>
<p>The stockbroking members of the committee would also include Humphrey Borkum, Doug Brooking, Bobby Johnston, Norman Lowenthal, Peter Redman and Geoff Rothschild, the exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
